The blue arc shows configured volume. The outer arc
shows illustrative audio activity.

10
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Red means Muted. Green means the microphone is Live.

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Muted shows a red crossed-out microphone and red text,
without a red panel border.

12
